 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Tires",
   "text": "All tires observed were matched by brand and had tread depths of 8/32nds at the front and 7/32nds at the rear. No spare tire is present."
  },
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "The exterior lights, windshield wipers, and washer functioned properly. Window and door seals are intact. Notably, there were no dents and the paint condition was good."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "I noted upon observation that the seats have no tears or rips. I tested the seat features throughout the vehicle and they all functioned properly. I noted no smoke or unusual odors. The climate controls and interior electronic systems worked as designed. The sunroof glass opened and closed without issue. I noted that the windows, locks, mirrors, and gauges operated properly."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "Some minor surface rust can be found on portions of the exhaust. Only one key fob was shown during inspection. I saw that the oil is okay and at the proper level, with no signs of excessive moisture or sludge under the oil fill cap. The brake fluid level appeared appropriate, and the coolant had the correct color, with no visual leaks noted in the system. Fasteners in the engine bay appeared generally intact and in place. Hoses, belts, axle boots, and visible bushings appeared to be sound. No visual leaks were noted from the engine bay."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "I hooked up my scanner and found no fault codes. The vehicle started and idled normally. I test drove the vehicle and the ride, acceleration, and handling felt normal. The engine was smooth and responsive. The transmission worked as designed without issues and the brakes exhibited firmness, with no noticeable pulsation."
  }
